  <item>
    <title>环球卷·江西 Vol.13 重镇的缘起、名楼的辉煌与海昏侯的美梦</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69fdac6e1b7bd50295babdf1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69fdac6e1b7bd50295babdf1</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 08 May 2026 09:42:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>吹着逐渐燥热的赣江江风，我们此次来到了江西，游访南昌、景德镇两地，从一座楼、一场起义，到一位沉睡两千年的诸侯王。</span></p><p><span>BGM: Dua Lipa - End Of The Era</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="200">03:20</a> 夜访与日览滕王阁：千年豫章风范</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="956">15:56</a> 江西省博物馆：神秘青铜器、元代国保、陶瓷</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1578">26:18</a> 赣江游船：领略琵琶行风采</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1737">28:57</a> 南昌八一起义纪念馆、万寿宫</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1858">30:58</a>海昏侯博物馆：论语、梦想与金钱</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2499">41:39</a> 景德镇奇妙之旅：陶瓷博物馆与御窑</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2806">46:46</a> 景德镇史：唐宋民窑 - 南宋景德 - 元明清官窑</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2658">44:18</a>、 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3207">53:27</a> 陶溪川、三宝村citywalk（那时候鸡排哥还没火，没吃成😭）</span></p><p><span>咖啡、美食：乐禾咖啡、宽暇、拾芥、不空山</span></p><p><span>春天来了、周福记汤包、野炉子、潜川面屋</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3473">57:53</a> 预告好客山东！ </span></p><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65b90ee2951233e0ded2eaf9/ltXltrxstwUb_kr0OYFym9_juBuH.m4a" length="58439602" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:00:10</itunes:duration>
