  <item>
    <title>环游卷·台州/阿那亚篇 Vol.12 寻找自己的精神领域：深山寻寺还是海边座谈</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69b39bdedfe027e304bf67d9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69b39bdedfe027e304bf67d9</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 13 Mar 2026 05:35:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期音频录制于2025年的春，恰巧时间都发生在同一个月，一南一北。南是与妹妹探访台州国清寺，享春之鲜味，正值江浙好风光；北是受朋友之邀，首次这么近那么美，前往河北秦皇岛阿那亚参与理想国读者日。也与此之际探索了下自己喜欢的寻求精神休憩之处究竟是什么方式，那么本期音频见啦～</span></p><span></span><p><span>台州/秦皇岛漫谈 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="70">01:10</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>国清寺何以带清字 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="338">05:38</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>国清寺漫游 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="424">07:04</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>鹅字碑 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="618">10:18</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>智者禅院 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="904">15:04</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>老街 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1191">19:51</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>石梁飞瀑 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1261">21:01</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>阿那亚 到达指北 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1536">25:36</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>关于读者日与姜文 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1643">27:23</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>附赠姜文讲座记录 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2294">38:14</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>阿那亚小众路线、读者日第二天（穿墙透壁、咏梅） <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1798">29:58</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>谈两地感 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2087">34:47</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>美食：三木咖啡、森然溪也火锅、晓麦穗、喜德咖啡</span></p><span></span><p><span>十三邀小酒馆</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65b90ee2951233e0ded2eaf9/liLNzuiId9KruStgZCdl6FfUiMbW.m4a" length="79323197" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:21:40</itunes:duration>
