  <item>
    <title>Vol.11来自Taylor Swift的幸福播报 首听The life of a showgirl</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/695e8bf5c1e012a7abeac9e8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">695e8bf5c1e012a7abeac9e8</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 07 Jan 2026 17:29:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期音频录制于Taylor Swift第12张专辑大碟The life of a showgirl发布当天，以极为兴奋的心情聆听经历了the eras tour盛大的巡演落幕、所有专辑版权的系数回归和新男友Travis Kelce的甜蜜时刻后taylor的第一人称视角叙事，或许这次是她为世界流行打下的强心剂。</span></p><p><span>介绍 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a></span></p><p><span>the fate of ophelia <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="64">01:04</a> &nbsp;(初听有点懵 和cardigan属于后劲型）</span></p><p><span>elizabeth taylor <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a></span></p><p><span>opalite <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="506">08:26</a> （我初听最喜欢的 一遍就能哼）</span></p><p><span>father figure <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="745">12:25</a></span></p><p><span>eldest daughter <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="955">15:55</a></span></p><p><span>ruin the friendship <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1199">19:59</a> 泪目</span></p><p><span>actually romantic <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> dddd</span></p><p><span>wi$h li$t <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1630">27:10</a></span></p><p><span>wood <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1835">30:35</a></span></p><p><span>cancelled! <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2020">33:40</a> rep味</span></p><p><span>honey <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2294">38:14</a></span></p><p><span>the life of a showgirl(feat. sabrina carpenter) <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2470">41:10</a></span></p><p><span>重听主打歌 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2710">45:10</a></span></p><p><span>原本录了结尾 但是找不到了 戛然而止也挺好的 这张专辑应该交给时间来评价 个人最喜欢的三首是：opalite ruin the friendship the life of a showgirl&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65b90ee2951233e0ded2eaf9/ll5z8YZcAsWnG1fLgsMSZThEaNOW.m4a" length="47879082" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:49:17</itunes:duration>
